(text "WIZ850io: one footprint with both 1x6 sockets (J1 = pads 1-6, J2 = pads 7-12), rows 17.78 mm (0.7 in) apart." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0d6502fd-f48f-4d9c-af0b-c81d550b2c2f))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2fc85f31-6ded-4c1f-b95d-29b3950669c0))
(text "microSD on the ESP32-S3 SD host, 1-bit mode. JP1 can disconnect DAT0 from GPIO3 (a strapping pin) if it upsets boot." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2265eef2-b68e-4e56-97bd-5df83e78f619))
